<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 01:46:25 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>放下工具，留下智慧</title><link>https://some.pics/6af51a6e47dc4</link><description>&lt;p&gt;放下一个工具并不会抹去你所学到的东西。如果你不再使用一副卡牌，你可以把它传给会喜欢它的人。你可以珍视与它共度的时光，而不必永远保留它。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted charcoal-and-rose fantasy scene of a silver-haired witch handing a boxed card deck to a friend at a riverside landing, while an enormous white swan carries a rose-trimmed passenger cabin. Warm ivory lettering fills the dark canopy, and the gold reference emblem appears at bottom-right. Text: Letting go of a tool doesn't erase what you learned. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6af51a6e47dc4.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 01:46:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>橡树</title><link>https://some.pics/6af50e77360b5</link><description>&lt;p&gt;橡树&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Low-angle view looking up through thick tree branches and green leaves lit by sunlight against a clear blue sky." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6af50e77360b5.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:55:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>你好墨西哥城</title><link>https://some.pics/6af4fb1bde84f</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你好，墨西哥城！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Night view of Mexico City from my hotel room's window" height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/axel/6af4fb1bde84f.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://axel.some.pics"&gt;@axel&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 23:32:47 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>林中迷路乐趣多</title><link>https://some.pics/6af4d4a99726d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在树林里迷路怎么会不好玩呢！树叶都落光了，我确实有时觉得本可以自己开辟小径，嗯，或者至少比实际走的更随性一些。😬&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Bare trees stand on a steep, leaf-covered slope in a dense, overcast forest." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6af4d4a99726d.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:48:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>山谷间寻桥跨沟</title><link>https://some.pics/6af4d280283ba</link><description>&lt;p&gt;没有什么比在这些山丘的山谷中找到跨越沟壑的桥梁更令人兴奋的了。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A wooden footbridge spans a small stream in a forest covered in fallen autumn leaves." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6af4d280283ba.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:39:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>背心</title><link>https://some.pics/6af4cfd58c04c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;背心&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Vest " height="1586" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/selah/6af4cfd58c04c.jpg" width="1320"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://selah.some.pics"&gt;@selah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:28:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>背心</title><link>https://some.pics/6af4cfabe4923</link><description>&lt;p&gt;背心&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Vest " height="1586" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/selah/6af4cfabe4923.jpg" width="1320"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://selah.some.pics"&gt;@selah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:27:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>背心</title><link>https://some.pics/6af4cf8cdf205</link><description>&lt;p&gt;背心&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Vest" height="1586" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/selah/6af4cf8cdf205.jpg" width="1320"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://selah.some.pics"&gt;@selah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:26:55 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>山谷水景视野</title><link>https://some.pics/6af4cf424e678</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我很喜欢这一点：如果你没有被树木遮挡，就能看到山谷和下方的水域。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="An eye-level shot captures a vibrant green clearing in a forest with sparse bare trees under a cloudy sky." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6af4cf424e678.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:25:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>原型</title><link>https://some.pics/6af4cf4644210</link><description>&lt;p&gt;原型&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Prototype" height="459" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/selah/6af4cf4644210.jpg" width="615"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://selah.some.pics"&gt;@selah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:25:45 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>